        <h1>Portland Compressor FAQ</h1>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-sm-12">
                <p>Here are some frequently asked questions and answers about, Portland Compressor, our site, sales tax, etc.</p>
                <h4>I live across the river in Vancouver, if I come to your store and buy this airless paint sprayer do I have to pay tax?</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>No, not to us, Oregon does not have a sales tax. We only collect sales tax for Washington if we ship or deliver product within that state.</li>
                    <li>NOTE: Most states that levy a sales tax require the resident to claim and pay sales tax on their tax return for items purchased out of state for use in their state. Check local laws in your state if you are unsure.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
